	"Version": 1,
	"VersionName": "0.1",
	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Held",
	"Description": "Held and thrown objects for the GSTN combat (M10). An object at rest is a dormant replicated actor; the host decides pickups (earliest request, then lower entity id), every machine draws a held object at its holder, and a throw is a GSTNProjectile shot with the object's hit data, so the hit, the credit to the thrower and the predicted ghost come from the projectile plugin unchanged. GSTNHeldCore is pure; GSTNHeldRuntime is the world side (needs the GAS-NPP fork).",
